{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>On the border of the land of Edom.</b> This teaches that because they joined here to draw close to Esau the wicked, their deeds were breached and they lost this righteous one. And so the prophet says to Jehoshaphat: ״בְּהִתְחַבֶּרְךָ עִם אֲחַזְיָהוּ פָּרַץ ה' אֶת מַעֲשֶׂיךָ״ (II Chronicles 20) (Tanchuma)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:47.147785294Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}